From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 10:21:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Sync offline playback progress: recordedAt and batch updates

PUT /api/v1/media/{id}/progress accepts an optional recordedAt. It is clamped
to the server clock, updates older than the stored progress are not applied
(the response reports applied=false with the stored values), and the watch
history entry is dated with it. POST /api/v1/progress/batch applies up to 500
queued updates oldest first, each succeeding or failing on its own.

